 Tips for getting started:

 1. Ask a question about this folder, or ask for a change
 2. Type @ to mention a file, ! to run a shell command, / for commands
 3. Shift+Tab cycles the local guard: ask, auto, plan

╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ > Try "explain what this project does"                                                           │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
 ! for shell mode                                double esc to rewind
 / for commands                                  shift+tab to cycle guard
 @ for file paths                                ctrl+o for transcript
 \⏎ or shift+⏎ for newline                       ctrl+r to search history
 ctrl+g to edit in $EDITOR                       ctrl+t to toggle todos
 ctrl+v to paste an image                        pgup/pgdn to scroll · shift+drag to select
